{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"特朗普：中國在美中俄和平宣言　首次譴責國際刑事法院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TRUMP-ICC-261121-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】美國總統特朗普談及美中俄三國在和平宣言中，一致認為國際刑事法院以及其他類似機構不得濫用管轄權。</p><p>美國總統特朗普：「中國也首次同意譴責國際刑事法院濫權及越權，它已經失控，我想說普京尤其不滿，但其他人也同樣不滿。」</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:03:52.769814+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:13:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T20:41:32.405977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:28.487187+00:00","content_hash":"76ef629644d43a65f83d034a67bc9a288c8d77528123ceae7d3c567a5001357f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}